{"4177000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "sYs - Save Your Soul", "steam_appid": 4177000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE THE DOOMED LAB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a prototype AI integrated into a robotic body and must escape a secret scientific facility. Left on your own, you’ll have to fight, explore, and craft not only your arsenal and tools, but also various machines essential for your survival. To succeed, you’ll need to gather ingredients and components scattered throughout abandoned complexes while facing malfunctioning robots that attack on sight. Analysis, crafting, and survival will be your only way out.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION AND DISCOVERY</strong></h2>Inspect every corner of the abandoned complexes. Analyze your surroundings, locate hidden resources, and consume oil to stay powered. Uncover locked or concealed areas crucial to your escape.</li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FORGE YOUR ARSENAL</strong></h2>Create your weapons, tools, and machines by combining ingredients and components. Build the equipment that will shape your way of surviving.</li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK AND CRAFT TO ADVANCE</strong></h2>Use your built-in analyzer and consult your codex to understand how to craft the devices required for your escape.</li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILT FOR VR</strong></h2>With your virtual hands, manipulate ingredients, reload your weapons, operate machines, and consume oil to keep your robotic body functioning. Every movement matters for surviving and progressing.</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will not guide you to the exit. It’s up to you to use your built-in analyzer and consult your codex to understand how to progress and find your way out.</p></p></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE THE DOOMED LAB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a prototype AI integrated into a robotic body and must escape a secret scientific facility. Left on your own, you’ll have to fight, explore, and craft not only your arsenal and tools, but also various machines essential for your survival. To succeed, you’ll need to gather ingredients and components scattered throughout abandoned complexes while facing malfunctioning robots that attack on sight. Analysis, crafting, and survival will be your only way out.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION AND DISCOVERY</strong></h2>Inspect every corner of the abandoned complexes. Analyze your surroundings, locate hidden resources, and consume oil to stay powered. Uncover locked or concealed areas crucial to your escape.</li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FORGE YOUR ARSENAL</strong></h2>Create your weapons, tools, and machines by combining ingredients and components. Build the equipment that will shape your way of surviving.</li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK AND CRAFT TO ADVANCE</strong></h2>Use your built-in analyzer and consult your codex to understand how to craft the devices required for your escape.</li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILT FOR VR</strong></h2>With your virtual hands, manipulate ingredients, reload your weapons, operate machines, and consume oil to keep your robotic body functioning. Every movement matters for surviving and progressing.</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will not guide you to the exit. It’s up to you to use your built-in analyzer and consult your codex to understand how to progress and find your way out.</p></p></p>", "short_description": "As a prototype AI trying to escape a secret facility, you explore abandoned complexes, gather ingredients, and craft weapons, tools, and machines. Face malfunctioning robots with no guidance and ingest oil to stay powered as you search for the exit.", "supported_languages": "English, French"